<ul>
<li data-marpit-fragment="1">to have up to date OSM data ?</li>
<li data-marpit-fragment="2">to work with small extent or a big extent ?
<ul>
<li data-marpit-fragment="3">By the way, what small extent and big extent ? (for online API)</li>
<li data-marpit-fragment="4">Density of data in different part of the worlds</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-marpit-fragment="5">to have OSM metadata such as contributor, changeset, timestamp ?</li>
<li data-marpit-fragment="6">data designed for display or analysis or routing or geocoding or … ?</li>
<li data-marpit-fragment="7">all OSM keys and values ?</li>
</ul>

</section>
