<ul>
<li data-marpit-fragment="1">Download the data on the fly</li>
<li data-marpit-fragment="2">Making requests to the Overpass API, similar to Overpass-Turbo
<ul>
<li data-marpit-fragment="3">Server API to retrieve raw OSM data based on queries (OQL)</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-marpit-fragment="4">QuickOSM 2.0.0 has been released</li>
<li data-marpit-fragment="5">Targeting both
<ul>
<li data-marpit-fragment="6"><strong>non OSM contributors</strong></li>
<li data-marpit-fragment="7">and OSM OverpassAPI <strong>experts</strong></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-marpit-fragment="8">It's removing the HStore field <code>other_tags</code> by exploding it</li>
<li data-marpit-fragment="9">As it's an API, limited amount of data</li>
<li data-marpit-fragment="10">Let's make an overview of this new version</li>
</ul>

</section>
